Orang ini mirip
sponsor AA-ku.

313
00:10:49,166 --> 00:10:51,291
Mirip tukang sampahku.

314
00:11:00,875 --> 00:11:01,833
Siapa kamu?

315
00:11:01,958 --> 00:11:03,208
Aku Brian.

316
00:11:03,333 --> 00:11:05,166
Kamu suka pesta, Brian?

317
00:11:05,291 --> 00:11:06,416
Aku suka pesta?

318
00:11:06,541 --> 00:11:07,625
Mm-hm.

319
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:10,708
Maksudku, di kampus,
ya, mungkin.

320
00:11:10,833 --> 00:11:11,750
Aku Leslie.

321
00:11:11,875 --> 00:11:13,291
Ini Ivy, Jess, dan Marla.

322
00:11:13,416 --> 00:11:14,791
Kami Mama Mafia.

323
00:11:14,916 --> 00:11:15,958
- Apa kabar?
- Apa kabar?

324
00:11:16,083 --> 00:11:19,291
Halo. Senang bertemu,
Mama Mafia.

325
00:11:19,416 --> 00:11:21,666
Kamu ambil tempat parkirku,
Brian?

326
00:11:21,791 --> 00:11:23,000
Oh, itu punyamu?

327
00:11:23,125 --> 00:11:24,625
Semua Honda Odyssey abu-abu?

328
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:25,625
Semua itu,
punyamu semua?

329
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:27,333
- Ya.
- SUV paling aman di pasaran

330
00:11:27,458 --> 00:11:28,583
dan warna abu-abu
paling jarang dicuri.

331
00:11:28,708 --> 00:11:29,833
Ada masalah?

332
00:11:29,958 --> 00:11:31,125
Tidak, aku tidak tahu.

333
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:32,875
Hanya terasa
aneh bagiku,

334
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,666
tapi aneh yang masuk akal.

335
00:11:34,791 --> 00:11:36,916
Seperti kamu punya
warna dan model yang sama.

336
00:11:37,041 --> 00:11:38,500
Itu keren.

337
00:11:38,625 --> 00:11:41,791
- Kantong camilan?
- Oh, terima kasih banyak.

338
00:11:41,916 --> 00:11:43,416
- Aku menghargainya.
- Itu untuk anak-anak.

339
00:11:43,541 --> 00:11:44,625
Ya, aku tahu.

340
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:46,541
Kembalikan, Brian.

341
00:11:46,666 --> 00:11:48,666
Kembalikan, Brian.

342
00:11:48,791 --> 00:11:50,416
Kamu sudah makan
terlalu banyak camilan.

343
00:11:50,541 --> 00:11:51,625
Jadi kamu mau bergabung?

344
00:11:51,750 --> 00:11:53,041
Kamu mau masuk mafia?

345
00:11:53,166 --> 00:11:54,416
Aku mau masuk
Mama Mafia?

346
00:11:54,541 --> 00:11:55,458
- Ya.
- Tidak.

347
00:11:55,583 --> 00:11:56,833
Aku bahkan tidak tahu.

348
00:11:56,958 --> 00:11:59,041
Kamu tahu, apa sebenarnya
Mama Mafia itu.

349
00:11:59,166 --> 00:12:00,791
Mudah. Hari kerja,
kami di sini jam 10 pagi,

350
00:12:00,916 --> 00:12:02,125
kami antar anak-anak,
mereka jadi heboh.

351
00:12:02,250 --> 00:12:04,416
Jam 12, kami konvoi
ke Chili's, makan siang,

352
00:12:04,541 --> 00:12:05,833
dan minum sampai mabuk.

353
00:12:05,958 --> 00:12:07,666
Tujuan utamanya memang mabuk!

354
00:12:09,875 --> 00:12:11,208
Ya, mau anggur?

355
00:12:11,333 --> 00:12:14,083
Aku... aku tidak banyak minum
di siang hari, tahu?

356
00:12:14,208 --> 00:12:16,583
Mau kokain? Ivy punya obat kuat.

357
00:12:16,708 --> 00:12:21,166
Tidak, bukan sekarang,
karena aku sedang menjaga anakku. Um--

358
00:12:21,291 --> 00:12:22,625
Kamu harus lepas
jaket itu.

359
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:24,083
- Oh.
- Kamu mau ikut masuk?

360
00:12:24,208 --> 00:12:25,250
- Ikut masuk?
- Ya.

361
00:12:25,375 --> 00:12:26,458
Kamu boleh tetap berpakaian.

362
00:12:26,583 --> 00:12:29,125
Uh, tidak langsung.
Kamu tahu maksudnya?

363
00:12:29,250 --> 00:12:30,625
Oh, itu Lucas.

364
00:12:30,750 --> 00:12:32,125
Baik, itu anakku.

365
00:12:32,250 --> 00:12:34,208
Dia suka berkeliaran
dan istriku membelikannya

366
00:12:34,333 --> 00:12:36,208
