Hmm.

427
00:14:34,708 --> 00:14:36,500
Anak ini selalu memasukkan
sesuatu ke mulutnya.

428
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:38,541
Anakmu pernah
melewati fase itu?

429
00:14:38,666 --> 00:14:40,375
Mungkin saat dia berusia satu.

430
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:42,541
Ya, kami agak lebih lama.

431
00:14:42,938 --> 00:14:44,433
Namaku Jeff.

432
00:14:44,558 --> 00:14:46,141
Uh, Brian.

433
00:14:46,266 --> 00:14:47,804
Hebat.

434
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:49,583
Kamu pernah dipanggil “Bri-Bri”?

435
00:14:49,708 --> 00:14:50,750
- Tidak.
- Ayolah.

436
00:14:50,875 --> 00:14:52,791
Bri-Bri itu nama keren, Kawan.

437
00:14:52,916 --> 00:14:54,625
Aku kenal Bri-Bri
di ketentaraan dulu.

438
